  "courseSlug": "react-native-the-practical-guide",
  "courseTitle": "React Native - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31404378",
      "title": "Creating an Overall Form",
      "lectureOrder": 148,
      "videoOrder": 144,
      "sourceHash": "ce6c1abad61eeb3539c0be28fcb3ec02d535a4c9b473b4dc6eb031e9198b78b8",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 3.21,
          "en": "So, how can we use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.21,
          "end": 6.65,
          "en": "this custom input component in expense form?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.65,
          "end": 9.61,
          "en": "Well, as we always use custom components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.61,
          "end": 13.17,
          "en": "we can simply add our input component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.17,
          "end": 15.69,
          "en": "add our import to it, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.69,
          "end": 17.66,
          "en": "and then use it in the JSX code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.66,
          "end": 21.12,
          "en": "like a custom component as we always do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.12,
          "end": 23.52,
          "en": "And we can add three custom components here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.52,
          "end": 26.003,
          "en": "for these three inputs that we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.12,
          "end": 30.16,
          "en": "Now with them added, we can configure them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.16,
          "end": 32.59,
          "en": "We can, for example, set the labels,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.59,
          "end": 35.64,
          "en": "and the first input could be dealing with the amount,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.64,
          "end": 38.22,
          "en": "so I will give it a label of amount.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.22,
          "end": 40.92,
          "en": "The second input could be dealing with the date,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.92,
          "end": 43.75,
          "en": "so I will give it a label of date.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.75,
          "end": 45.99,
          "en": "And the third input could be dealing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.99,
          "end": 48.01,
          "en": "with the description of the expense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.01,
          "end": 50.61,
          "en": "so I will give it an appropriate label.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.61,
          "end": 54.69,
          "en": "With that, if we now use the expense form in manage expense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.69,
          "end": 59.4,
          "en": "so if we go there and we add our expense form here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.4,
          "end": 63.25,
          "en": "our custom component in the manage expense component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.25,
          "end": 66.36,
          "en": "so if we add it here in the JSX code like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.36,
          "end": 69.28999999999999,
          "en": "and we, of course, also import it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.28999999999999,
          "end": 73.03,
          "en": "from our expense form file in the manage expense folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.03,
          "end": 74.74,
          "en": "in the components folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.74,
          "end": 77.423,
          "en": "if we do all that and we save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.34,
          "end": 81.408,
          "en": "we should therefore be able to open the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.408,
          "end": 84.22,
          "en": "And even though it's a bit hard to read",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.22,
          "end": 86.64,
          "en": "because we haven't added any styling yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.64,
          "end": 89.78999999999999,
          "en": "we can see our three labels here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.78999999999999,
          "end": 92.7,
          "en": "The text input elements are actually also here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.7,
          "end": 94.75,
          "en": "as you can see if you try to click in them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.75,
          "end": 98.38,
          "en": "but you can't see them because they have no styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.38,
          "end": 100.18,
          "en": "Still, this is being rendered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.18,
          "end": 103.36,
          "en": "and we can, therefore of course also work on the styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.36,
          "end": 104.602,
          "en": "But before we do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.602,
          "end": 108.38,
          "en": "I want to finish the configuration of my different inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 108.38,
          "end": 111.44,
          "en": "because of course, they don't just need a label.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.44,
          "end": 115.25999999999999,
          "en": "Instead, if the first input here is the amount,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.25999999999999,
          "end": 119.16,
          "en": "we also want to set up our text input config here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.16,
          "end": 121.54,
          "en": "and set this to an object as you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.54,
          "end": 124.2,
          "en": "which will then be transformed into props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.2,
          "end": 128.4,
          "en": "on the text input inside of that custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.4,
          "end": 130.92,
          "en": "And here, we can then set all the prop values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.92,
          "end": 134.38,
          "en": "that are supported by our text input component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.38,
          "end": 135.343,
          "en": "by React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.22,
          "end": 139.81,
          "en": "For example, here on this first text input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.81,
          "end": 141.59,
          "en": "which deals with the amount,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.59,
          "end": 143.44,
          "en": "we could set the keyboard,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 143.44,
          "end": 147.293,
          "en": "type here to decimal pad.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 148.32,
          "end": 150.716,
          "en": "Decimal pad is one of the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.716,
          "end": 154.86,
          "en": "that is supported on both platforms,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.86,
          "end": 156.63,
          "en": "and this will ensure that when a user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.63,
          "end": 159.82999999999998,
          "en": "taps into the keyboard, we open up a keyboard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 159.82999999999998,
          "end": 163.95,
          "en": "on the device that makes entering decimal numbers easier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.95,
          "end": 167.19299999999998,
          "en": "and makes entering text pretty much impossible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.29,
          "end": 171.453,
          "en": "We can also add another property here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.453,
          "end": 173.749,
          "en": "another prop value therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.749,
          "end": 178.749,
          "en": "And that could be the on change text property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.45,
          "end": 182.01,
          "en": "This will add the on change text prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.01,
          "end": 183.89,
          "en": "to the underlying text input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.89,
          "end": 186.48,
          "en": "And this allows us to point at a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 186.48,
          "end": 187.9,
          "en": "that should be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 187.9,
          "end": 191.289,
          "en": "whenever a user enters a value here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.289,
          "end": 193.53,
          "en": "And we could add such a function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 193.53,
          "end": 198.32999999999998,
          "en": "the amount changed handler for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 198.32999999999998,
          "end": 201.013,
          "en": "and point at this function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.013,
          "end": 201.846,
          "en": "(indistinct)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 201.846,
          "end": 203.313,
          "en": "Amount changed handler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 204.16,
          "end": 206.45,
          "en": "This would allow us to register key strokes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 206.45,
          "end": 209.1,
          "en": "and store them in some state later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 209.1,
          "end": 210.81,
          "en": "Now for the moment, I'll just keep this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 210.81,
          "end": 212.57999999999998,
          "en": "as an empty function around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 212.57999999999998,
          "end": 216.47,
          "en": "We will work on handling user input a little bit later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 216.47,
          "end": 219.35,
          "en": "But that's how we could add props here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 219.35,
          "end": 220.81,
          "en": "Now, we also got more inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 220.81,
          "end": 222.28,
          "en": "that need to be configured though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 222.28,
          "end": 224.47,
          "en": "For example, the date.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 224.47,
          "end": 228.48,
          "en": "There, I also want to add my text input config prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 228.48,
          "end": 230.32,
          "en": "and pass an object to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 230.32,
          "end": 232.737,
          "en": "Now here, I don't want to set the keyboards type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 232.737,
          "end": 236.82999999999998,
          "en": "because there is no date specific keyboard type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 236.82999999999998,
          "end": 238.04399999999998,
          "en": "we could use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 238.04399999999998,
          "end": 241.6,
          "en": "Instead, I will keep the default keyboard type,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 241.6,
          "end": 244.28,
          "en": "which allows us to enter both text and numbers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 244.28,
          "end": 247.26,
          "en": "But I do want to add the placeholder prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 248.12,
          "end": 252.3,
          "en": "because that is another prop supported by text input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 252.3,
          "end": 255.398,
          "en": "Placeholder, which shows a short text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 255.398,
          "end": 259.4,
          "en": "which is visible before the user starts entering values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 259.4,
          "end": 261.53,
          "en": "And here, I want to give the user a hint",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 261.53,
          "end": 265,
          "en": "about the format I expect to get for the date.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 265,
          "end": 267.23,
          "en": "Because I want the user to enter the year",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 267.23,
          "end": 269.71,
          "en": "with four characters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 269.71,
          "end": 273.57,
          "en": "then the month separated from the year by a dash,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 273.57,
          "end": 276.02,
          "en": "then another dash, and then the day.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 276.02,
          "end": 277.82,
          "en": "I expected this kind of input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 277.82,
          "end": 281.63,
          "en": "and therefore that's the placeholder value I will set here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 281.63,
          "end": 283.293,
          "en": "to get this extra hint.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 284.27,
          "end": 286.25,
          "en": "In addition, I want to make sure that the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 286.25,
          "end": 288.4,
          "en": "can't enter anything longer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 288.4,
          "end": 291.51,
          "en": "so we can add the max length property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 291.51,
          "end": 296.44,
          "en": "because max length is another prop that is supported here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 296.44,
          "end": 300.09,
          "en": "Max length, and this restricts the number of characters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 300.09,
          "end": 301.563,
          "en": "that can be entered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 302.95,
          "end": 306.42,
          "en": "And I want to set max length to a number of 10",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 306.42,
          "end": 309.69,
          "en": "because we only need 10 characters to enter this state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 309.69,
          "end": 311.15,
          "en": "in this format.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 311.15,
          "end": 313.2,
          "en": "We have four characters for the year,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 313.2,
          "end": 315.7,
          "en": "two for the month, two for the day,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 315.7,
          "end": 318.81,
          "en": "and then one each for the dashes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 318.81,
          "end": 322.17,
          "en": "Now, we also might want to add on change text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 322.17,
          "end": 324.22,
          "en": "but for the moment, I'll set this to an empty function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 324.22,
          "end": 326.17,
          "en": "and add the actual function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 326.17,
          "end": 328.263,
          "en": "for handling input changes later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 329.12,
          "end": 331.48,
          "en": "But that's it for the date input for me here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 331.48,
          "end": 332.48,
          "en": "though, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 332.48,
          "end": 335.366,
          "en": "feel free to browse through all these props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 335.366,
          "end": 338.363,
          "en": "and add more configuration if you want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 339.40999999999997,
          "end": 341.56,
          "en": "Now, we also have the description here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 341.56,
          "end": 343.43,
          "en": "and on that description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 343.43,
          "end": 346.64300000000003,
          "en": "I also want to add my text input config,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 346.64300000000003,
          "end": 348.8,
          "en": "and here on the description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 348.8,
          "end": 352.15999999999997,
          "en": "I actually want to set a couple of other values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 352.15999999999997,
          "end": 355.883,
          "en": "or at least discuss a couple of other config values.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
